Here's an update on our Sunday travels. We managed to catch a different
train after waiting only around an hour and a half or so, but waiting an
hour at one station, and being on another long train=E2=80=A6 We're not gon=
na be
able to make it For our interviews with Sano=E4=BC=9A=E9=95=B7 =F0=9F=98=A2=
 We will just have to wait
